---
source: misc/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"namei\")"
---
Follow a pathname until a terminal point is found

Usage: namei [options] <pathname>...

Arguments:
  <PATHNAMES>...  Pathnames to follow

Options:
  -l, --long         Long listing (equivalent to -m -o -v)
  -m, --modes        Show the mode bits of each file type
  -n, --nosymlinks   Don't follow symlinks
  -o, --owners       Show owner and group name
  -v, --vertical     Vertically align modes and owners
  -x, --mountpoints  Show mountpoints with 'D' instead of 'd'
  -h, --help         Print help
